  <Danger>k__BackingField: One cannonball hit and you're out. Cannons turn toward
    their target right before they fire.
  <Scoring>k__BackingField: Last one standing wins; survivors tie at the bell.
  <Controls>k__BackingField:
  - SPACE|Jump over cannonballs
  - LMB|Shove
